tle":"cmd: add environment variable to disable/enable 'Terminate batch job (Y/N)?' confirmation","comments":70,"created_at":"2018-07-07T08:25:18Z"},{"number":1379,"title":"Add support for turning off cursor blink","comments":69,"created_at":"2019-06-22T04:08:45Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":20915,"title":">/< Proposal : Native Arabic Support and RTL Experience for Windows Terminal >/<","comments":2,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2026-11-11T19:41:43Z"},{"number":20910,"title":"Windows Terminal Preview v1.26.3133.0","comments":1,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2026-11-11T00:12:18Z"},{"number":20909,"title":"Windows Terminal v1.25.3131.0","comments":0,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2026-11-11T00:12:16Z"},{"number":20882,"title":"tstyles: preview Windows Terminal themes live from PowerShell","comments":1,"category":"Show and tell","created_at":"2026-11-03T00:46:08Z"},{"number":20806,"title":"Un-Expand/Shrink word-wise selection and navigation in mark mode","comments":0,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2026-10-15T06:31:14Z"},{"number":20759,"title":"Windows Terminal Preview v1.26.2734.0","comments":0,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2026-10-02T20:27:34Z"},{"number":20758,"title":"Windows Terminal v1.25.2733.0","comments":0,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2026-10-02T20:27:27Z"},{"number":20757,"title":"Windows Terminal v1.24.12741.0","comments":0,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2026-10-02T20:27:20Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"Windows Terminal v1.25.3131.0","tag":"v1.25.3131.0","published_at":"2026-11-11T00:12:16Z","body":"With this release, Terminal 1.25 is being rolled out to General Availability; see [the prior version](https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/releases/tag/v1.25.2733.0) for overall release notes.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n* (1.26 backport) conhost: we now always use the \"cls\" detector to prevent screen clearing from committing the entire (virtualized) text buffer (#19957)\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n \r\n### Accessibility\r\n \r\n* The \"delete\" confirmation flyouts will no longer be truncated on higher Text Scaling settings (#20868)\r\n \r\n### Terminal Emulation\r\n\r\n* The Kitty Keyboard Protocol mode will now be maintained properly across main/alternate screen buffer switches (#20768)\r\n* `LNM` line feed mode will no longer be mishandled when it is toggled before and after a newline in the same packet (#20863)\r\n* Applications can no longer set window titles longer than 1000 characters (like xterm) (#20839)\r\n* Applications which scroll the screen buffer will once again be translated properly (such as `vi` from 1996) (#20774)\r\n* Clicking on a URL while an application is reading mouse reports will no longer generate a spurious mouse release event (#20756) (thanks @OmarMashal0!) (edit: er, I (@DHowett) cannot confirm that this is actually fixed)\r\n* Injected keyboard input will no longer come out with unexpected vkey values such as `0xFFFF` (#20800) (thanks @shrikargs7-cloud!)\r\n* Terminal once again sends the `ENHANCED_KEY` state to console applications for Alt and F7 (#20619) (thanks @TheJesper!)\r\n \r\n### Others\r\n\r\n* `useAcrylicInTabRow` users rejoice! We've fixed one of the major sources of flickering in the title bar (#20881)\r\n* `file:` URIs containing Unicode characters will no longer send us into a wild tailspin (#20809)\r\n* Terminal will no longer load up a US keyboard on you (whoops) (#20769)\r\n* Writing a non-numeric value in the command history pop-up will no longer act unexpectedly (#20779)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n_Binary files inside the unpackaged distribution archive bear the version number `1.25.261109001`._\r\n\r\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Typing inside of the default WSL terminal feels amazing (2018)","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/issues/327","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=21862087","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2019-12-23","points":332,"comments":117},{"